    "answer": {
      "short": "75 counters",
      "worked": "The number of orange counters stays the same. Express both blue:orange ratios with 12 parts for orange counters.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Before: blue:orange}&=1:4=3:12\\\\\\text{After: blue:orange}&=1:3=4:12\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe 5 added blue counters represent the increase from 3 to 4 parts.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}1\\text{ part}&=5\\text{ counters}\\\\\\text{Original total parts}&=3+12\\\\&=15\\\\\\text{Original total counters}&=15\\times5\\\\&=75\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere were 75 counters in the bag at the start.",
